 FM 1113.\n\nThe property boasts a picturesque setting with mountain views on three sides. It’s currently AG exempt, maintained by a cow/calf operation, and features a 13 acre pasture planted in hay grazer, along with multiple native grass pastures ideal for livestock rotation.\n\nThe ranch is fully fenced with barbed wire perimeter fencing and cross-fencing. Water is plentiful, with three stock ponds and multiple troughs supplied by a water meter from Topsey Water.\n\nThe terrain ranges from level to gently sloping, blanketed with mature oak trees that provide shade and beauty throughout the property. Abundant wildlife, including whitetail deer, hogs, dove, and more, makes this an excellent recreational or hunting property as well. In Copperas Cove ISD.", "channel_id": "UCNOSkbUuJkPSNre7oBvn-kA", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNOSkbUuJkPSNre7oBvn-kA", "duration": 118, "view_count": 455, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hsy4rBKeMhQ", "categories": ["People & Blogs"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "comment_count": 1, "like_count": 10, "channel": "Longhorn Realty", "channel_follower_count": 101, "uploader": "Longhorn Realty", "uploader_id": "@LonghornRealty", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LonghornRealty", "upload_date": "20250830", "timestamp": 1756512283, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "display_id": "hsy4rBKeMhQ", "fulltitle": "88+ Acres, Ag Exempt & Unrestricted Copperas Cove TX Ranch for Sale in Coryell County", "duration_string": "1:58", "is_live": false, "was_live": false, "epoch": 1784918365, "format": "299 - 1920x1080 (1080p60)+251 - audio only (medium)", "format_id": 